{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05320","headline":"晦日宴高文学林亭 · 张锡","name":"晦日宴高文学林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雪尽铜驼路，花照石崇家。\n年光开柳色，池影泛云华。\n赏洽情方远，春归景未赊。\n欲知多暇日，尊酒渍澄霞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05320.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05320","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}